# Keystore files / signing keys — NEVER commit these.
# The .der key signs the published Connect IQ app; leaking it means anyone can
# publish updates as you, and it cannot be rotated without orphaning the
# existing store listing.
*.jks
*.keystore
developer_key
developer_key*
*.der
*.pem
*.key

